### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get contact by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/691760088d03b5b6e2e7fdac

### Create a contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nasibu",
